# NestJS Rules (override)

## Validation
- **Use Zod for ALL DTOs**. Create them via `createZodDto()` (nestjs-zod) or a custom wrapper.
- Replace the default `ValidationPipe` with **`ZodValidationPipe`** in `main.ts`.
- No `class-validator` / `class-transformer` in new code (legacy allowed only until migrated).

## Architecture
- Controllers = thin routers, import DTOs directly from `@/dto`.
- Services = stateless, injected via constructor.
- Repositories wrap Prisma; business logic lives in services.

## Code style additions
- Function ≤ 20 LOC, single responsibility.
- Prefix async methods with verb (`fetchUsers`).
- Prefer `map/filter/reduce` over imperative loops.

## Testing
- Unit-test every service & controller with Zod schema mocks.
- E2E tests per API module.
